    "GA4 booking tracking has recovered: <code>sevenrooms_booking_complete</code> was dead at all three USA properties from 16 to 20 October 2026 and came back on Wednesday 21 October. Market create-path bookings by day were 4 and 1 on 19 and 20 October, then 49, 54, 47, 60 and 46, so this week is a five-day reading and the GA4 booking, conversion-rate and landing-page figures on this page understate the market by roughly 110 bookings. SevenRooms took 86 website bookings on 19 and 20 October against 5 GA4 events. Meta and Google figures are unaffected in either week.",
