    "Google booking conversions and modelled store visits settle upward for two to three weeks. Last week's Hutong NYC reading has already moved from 8.0 to 13.0 and the walk-in panels moved from 101 to 196 at Aqua NYC, 285 to 500 at Hutong NYC and 112 to 184 at Hutong Miami, so this week's counts are a floor and cost per booking a ceiling."
